// Module under test: lib/watchdog.csp, loaded by {lib, ...} in the .expect.
// Src ticks along for the first ten cycles and then goes quiet for good. Lost
// must stay down while the signal is alive and come up one deadline after the
// last sign of life -- and Age must stop at the deadline rather than run on.
#variable Src = 0
#variable n = 0
#Watchdog wt Tk.period=5 Deadline=30
n = n + 1
Src = Src + 1 ? n < 10
wt.In = Src
